# CHANGELOG

## [0.1.0] - 2026-04-06

### Added

- Tauri 2 + React 18 + TypeScript scaffold (`pnpm tauri dev` opens WSLg window).
- Design tokens integrated into app entry point (`tokens.css` imported in `main.tsx`).
- Vitest + React Testing Library configured.
- GitHub Actions CI: TypeScript check, React tests, Rust tests, clippy on every push.
- GitHub Actions Realease: AppImage + .deb built on tag push.
- Token sync lint script (`scripts/lint-tokens.sh`) added to CI.

### Fixed

- Dark mode `--shadow-palette` override missing from `tokens.css` (ECH D2).
- Dark accent hex corrected to `#5b9fe0` to match spce (ECH D1),
